# Licence

The driver code in this repository is derived from
[Sigfrodr/libfprint-goodixtls](https://github.com/Sigfrodr/libfprint-goodixtls)
and remains **LGPL-2.1-or-later**. The full text is in [`COPYING`](COPYING).

That covers the patches and any source here that builds on the driver. The
upstream libfprint TOD fork (fetched by `bootstrap.sh`) carries its own
LGPL-2.1-or-later licence, and the build scripts, documentation and diagnostic
tools in this repository are offered under the same terms for simplicity.

This project contains no vendor binaries, no firmware images and no captured
biometric data.
